{"timestamp":"2026-09-03T23:42:21.331Z","ordinal":23537,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a069a6-e893-7ae3-93f2-3fa545feb755","author":"/root/pr184_ubuntu_ci","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_ubuntu_ci\nPayload:\nImplemented the AST-scoped Python alias resolution patch.\n\n- `from m import compute as c; c()` resolves/reports `m.compute`.\n- Same-language, C/FFI, top-level, parenthesized, sequential, sibling, shadowed, module-only, ambiguous, and incomplete cases covered.\n- Focused `internal/sem` test matrix passed; `git diff --check` clean.\n- Uncommitted changes: `provider.go`, `python_scopes.go`, `provider_test.go`."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788478941.331184}}}
