om https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph\n * branch              main       -> FETCH_HEAD\n * branch              fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> FETCH_HEAD\n   071afb51..a09defd6  fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges\n10b604e1c6a80d4e90f8a4e2a3cb6e19c489958e\n9cdc0592352da8987ee727d8e1cfd0bf871ae4a5\na09defd6cd761a39199e3b3ca6d47c24e5581e6c\n> a09defd6 (origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges) fix(sem): let C name the extern \"C\" half of a dual-use C++ header\n< 10b604e1 (HEAD -> fix/cross-language-name-only-edges) fix: model Python function header scopes\n< 7b3ea7bc fix(sem): let C name the plain C half of an Objective-C header\n< d00b2c6e fix: cover Python scoped import syntax\n> 071afb51 fix(sem): let C name the plain C half of an Objective-C header\n> 6c91abc6 fix(sem): resolve Python signature calls and parenthesised imports\n> bcab9549 fix(sem): resolve a Python import alias to the member it renames\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":784414653},"formatted_output":"From https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph\n * branch              main       -> FETCH_HEAD\n * branch              fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> FETCH_HEAD\n   071afb51..a09defd6  fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges\n10b604e1c6a80d4e90f8a4e2a3cb6e19c489958e\n9cdc0592352da8987ee727d8e1cfd0bf871ae4a5\na09defd6cd761a39199e3b3ca6d47c24e5581e6c\n> a09defd6 (origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges) fix(sem): let C name the extern \"C\" half of a dual-use C++ header\n< 10b604e1 (HEAD -> fix/cross-language-name-only-edges) fix: model Python function header scopes\n< 7b3ea7bc fix(sem): let C name the plain C half of an Objective-C header\n< d00b2c6e fix: cover Python scoped import syntax\n> 071afb51 fix(sem): let C name the plain C half of an Objective-C header\n> 6c91abc6 fix(sem): resolve Python signature calls and parenthesised imports\n> bcab9549 fix(sem): resolve a Python import al