{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T00:15:43.871Z","ordinal":24257,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a069c5-76ff-79b2-ad09-c78996642c4b","author":"/root/pr184_try_scope_port","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_try_scope_port\nPayload:\nImplemented in `/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/.entire/worktrees/pr184-review`:\n\n- Updated `python_scopes.go` for:\n  - `asPatternAlias`\n  - proper `except_clause`/`except_group_clause` walking and binding\n  - correct `with_item` alias handling\n  - `as_pattern_target` destructuring\n- Added focused exception/with scope tests and FFI helpers in `call_resolution_precision_test.go`.\n- Ran `gofmt` and `git diff --check`.\n- Focused tests pass.\n\nBroader Python tests still fail only because `provider_test.go` retains the old `except_type` expectation; remote commit updates that test, but I left it untouched per scope instructions. No commit created."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788480943.871128}}}
