{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T00:40:21.406Z","ordinal":24675,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a069dc-029e-73d3-ba5b-0ee99734082e","author":"/root/pr184_c_linkage_finish","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_c_linkage_finish\nPayload:\nAddressed Luna’s final finding in the assigned uncommitted files; no commit/push.\n\n- Rejects C-linkage for aggregate fields containing `storage_class_specifier` (including `static`/`mutable` shapes).\n- Rejects nested struct/union/class declarations with no member declarator.\n- Retains valid nested aggregates with declarators, including the emitted inner tag, and preserves function-pointer callback fields.\n- Added direct linkage and C-edge assertions for positives and negatives, plus default-member and `mutable` challenge cases.\n\nVerified:\n\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^(TestTreeSitterParserDetectsCPlusPlusHeaders|TestCNamesOnlyExternCDeclarationsInCPlusPlusHeaders|TestProviderGoldenSnapshots)$' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestTreeSitterParserCPlusPlus' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestEntitySymbolsKeepCompoundIDStableAcrossBodyEdits$' -count=1`\n- `gofmt` and `git diff --check` pass."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788482421.406438}}}
