{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T00:45:24.588Z","ordinal":24753,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a069e0-a2ec-7333-831a-c90280f7d6e7","author":"/root/pr184_c_linkage_finish","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_c_linkage_finish\nPayload:\nFixed the anonymous-member regression; no commit/push.\n\n`cxxNestedAggregateWithoutField` now rejects only a tagged nested struct/union/class with no declarator. Anonymous C11 struct/union members remain C-compatible, while tagged declaration-only and tagged-with-declarator behavior stays correct.\n\nAdded anonymous struct/union C-consumer, direct `cLinkage`, and resolution-positive coverage.\n\nVerified:\n\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestCNamesOnlyExternCDeclarationsInCPlusPlusHeaders$' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^(TestTreeSitterParserDetectsCPlusPlusHeaders|TestProviderGoldenSnapshots)$' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestEntitySymbolsKeepCompoundIDStableAcrossBodyEdits$' -count=1`\n- `gofmt` and `git diff --check` pass."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788482724.588068}}}
