{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T00:56:07.566Z","ordinal":24945,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a069ea-728e-7cb2-a6da-7bec1fa2e5bb","author":"/root/pr184_try_scope_port","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_try_scope_port\nPayload:\nPorted the manual 0ac58656 scope behavior:\n\n- Function names bind at body offset, preserving enclosing imports for defaults/annotations while resolving recursion as local.\n- Class pre-definition views hide the class’s own binding for bases, class-body execution, and method signatures.\n- Deferred method bodies resolve through the completed enclosing scope and see the class binding.\n- Added hidden-event handling to `contextAt`/`hasBindingAt`.\n- Integrated deferred scope behavior with existing `lexicalContainer`/`headerNestedParent`.\n- Added focused function/class scope tests.\n\nValidation passed:\n\n- Full `TestPython` matrix\n- Scope/Alias/try/golden matrices\n- Focused definition/try/with tests\n- `gofmt`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nNo commit/push created."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788483367.566622}}}
