{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T00:59:04.060Z","ordinal":25029,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0616d-0c18-7443-82f2-b4c5bc498542","turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_064395e280df5569016a9a17d6a9e487d0a531b57e0f52be92","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Both local fix sets now pass their focused matrices. One detail is under adversarial review: the class “pre-binding” view currently hides by name/offset, so I’m checking it cannot accidentally mask a later binding introduced inside a base expression. That is exactly the sort of regression we need to eliminate before calling the Trail clean."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788483542551,"completed_at_ms":1788483544060}}
