n":{"secs":0,"nanos":922936139},"formatted_output":"From https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph\n * branch              main       -> FETCH_HEAD\n * branch              fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> FETCH_HEAD\n   cd7177e4..9b60f3d1  fix/cross-language-name-only-edges -> origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges\n## fix/cross-language-name-only-edges...origin/fix/cross-language-name-only-edges [ahead 9, behind 9]\n9cdc0592352da8987ee727d8e1cfd0bf871ae4a5\n9b60f3d1fa50a4e687510c933f9cc30e8c8321e9\n< ab6a67b4 fix: model Python definition binding time\n> 9b60f3d1 fix(sem): find the Python from-import keyword, not a literal \" import \"\n> 4508c119 fix(sem): a Python lambda's defaults are enclosing-scoped\n< b0ada641 fix: let Objective-C use C linkage declarations\n< 47b77331 fix: restrict C linkage to compatible declarations\n> cd7177e4 fix(sem): let Objective-C name the extern \"C\" half of a dual-use C++ header\n> 0ac58656 fix(sem): a Python definition binds its own name after its signature\n< be0e022d fix: preserve Python bindings through compound syntax\n< 72d2c274 fix: resolve Python aliases in lexical scope\n> 20d89c01 fix(sem): a Python try statement is code of its own scope\n< 10b604e1 fix: model Python function header scopes\n< d00b2c6e fix: cover Python scoped import syntax\n> 6c91abc6 fix(sem): resolve Python signature calls and parenthesised imports\n> bcab9549 fix(sem): resolve a Python import alias to the member it renames\n"},"started_at_ms":1788485378419,"completed_at_ms":1788485379343}}
