{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T01:38:31.364Z","ordinal":25814,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a06a11-4343-78d1-abc1-a165e3ea57d6","author":"/root/pr188_final_luna","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr188_final_luna\nPayload:\nImplemented the minimal shared-parser port:\n\n- `pythonFromImportParts` now accepts legal `from mod import(item)` syntax.\n- Existing tab-separated forms remain supported.\n- Full-line `from`/module anchoring is preserved.\n- `from importlib import compute` remains correctly parsed.\n- Star imports remain non-bindings.\n- Multiline parenthesized imports and malformed-list recovery remain intact.\n\nAdded focused coverage for all of the above. Passed:\n\n- Focused keyword-boundary tests\n- Full `TestPython.*`\n- Alias/try/golden matrix\n- `gofmt`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nNo other files were changed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788485911.363972}}}
