{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T01:42:58.584Z","ordinal":25879,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a06a15-5718-7be2-8af6-7fe9f59ca23e","author":"/root/pr188_final_luna","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr188_final_luna\nPayload:\nFixed the parser finding in the shared parser:\n\n- Replaced the restrictive post-`import` regex with exact keyword-boundary parsing.\n- Accepts whitespace, `(`, `*`, and backslash continuation after `import`.\n- Rejects `importcompute`.\n- Preserves full-line `from` and module anchoring.\n- Keeps `importlib` intact.\n- Strengthened star-import coverage: `scanPythonImports` retains module `mod`, while scope binding remains empty.\n- Added named backslash-continuation resolution coverage.\n- Retained multiline and malformed-input tests.\n\nAll requested focused parser, full Python, alias/try/golden tests, `gofmt`, and `git diff --check` pass."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788486178.584881}}}
