{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T01:58:39.280Z","ordinal":26102,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0616d-0c18-7443-82f2-b4c5bc498542","turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_064395e280df5569016a9a25cddb8887d0aa2f12b54b029ea0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Both remote fixes are real, but one has a correctness hole: it would treat a value-less annotation as an assignment, and its new `case` capture logic misses module/class execution order. I’m having Luna port the two timing fixes with those two small corrections—this is a scoped continuation, not a rewrite."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788487117847,"completed_at_ms":1788487119280}}
