{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:22:40.627Z","ordinal":26391,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a06a39-aff3-7b00-9f41-bd829292b4f2","author":"/root/pr188_final_terra","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr188_final_terra\nPayload:\nP2 — code is clean, but the new test only covers part of the required safety matrix at [call_resolution_precision_test.go:1087](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/.entire/worktrees/pr184-review/internal/sem/call_resolution_precision_test.go:1087).\n\nMissing regression cases:\n\n- Function-local import must not leak into a different function’s `ASYNC_CALLS` **and** `DATA_FLOWS`.\n- Aliased `from frobnicate import compute as run` needs a `DATA_FLOWS` positive, not only async.\n- C/Ruby ambiguity needs async and data-flow negatives.\n- Definition/class and delayed-rebinding scope cases need sibling-scan negatives, especially a class/method shadow and a call after local reassignment.\n\nThe implementation itself preserves the intended behavior:\n\n- `pythonCallImportBinding` makes existing CALLS inputs equivalent while centralizing the complete/incomplete Python gate.\n- Async/data use the same raw-import widening and scoped import replacement.\n- `genericAllowed` prevents alias/module spellings from falling through to a coincidental workspace symbol; alias targets are then safely unioned.\n- Non-Python inputs, resolution metadata, confidence caps, evidence, and dedupe loops are unchanged.\n\nThe current direct tests genuinely inspect `ASYNC_CALLS` and `DATA_FLOWS`, not incidental CALLS; they pass, as do focused existing FFI tests.\n\nCommands passed:\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- `gofmt -d internal/sem/provider.go internal/sem/provider_test.go`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestPythonScopedImportBindingExtendsAsyncAndDataFlow$' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestPython' -count=1`\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^(TestBareImportedCallResolvesAcrossFFIBoundary|TestBareImportedCallIgnoresImportLocalToAnotherFunction|TestPythonAliasedImportedCallResolvesToItsOriginalName)$' -count=1`"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788488560.627304}}}
