{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:25:46.960Z","ordinal":26433,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a06a3c-87d0-71a1-8c63-01827209f883","author":"/root/pr188_final_terra","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr188_final_terra\nPayload:\nP1 — the two “C and Ruby ambiguity” cases do not exercise import-based raw widening, so they can pass without this port.\n\nAt [call_resolution_precision_test.go:1168](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/.entire/worktrees/pr184-review/internal/sem/call_resolution_precision_test.go:1168) and [call_resolution_precision_test.go:1175](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/.entire/worktrees/pr184-review/internal/sem/call_resolution_precision_test.go:1175), the fixture has no `from frobnicate import compute`, and the Ruby file is `other.rb`, which would not match that module anyway. The test therefore only proves ordinary unimported cross-language resolution stays absent.\n\nFix both fixtures to import `compute` from `frobnicate`, place the Ruby callable at `frobnicate.rb` (or `lib/frobnicate.rb`), and assert no relation at all from `plain` for the requested relation type—not merely no edge to the C target. That verifies `resolveUniqueRawImportedCallTarget` rejects the ambiguous C/Ruby import instead of choosing either candidate.\n\nEverything else remains clean:\n\n- Production diff is unchanged from the prior review and preserves CALLS behavior.\n- Scoped raw widening, alias union/gating, local-import isolation, rebinding, class-definition shadowing, provenance/confidence, and relation-specific scanning are correct.\n- The expanded tests genuinely query `ASYNC_CALLS` or `DATA_FLOWS`.\n\nPassed:\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- `gofmt -d internal/sem/provider.go internal/sem/call_resolution_precision_test.go`\n- narrow new test\n- `go test ./internal/sem -run '^TestPython' -count=1`\n- focused FFI tests"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788488746.960006}}}
