{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:03:27.872Z","ordinal":26944,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a06a5f-0780-77c1-93ea-a4a35e103c68","author":"/root/pr184_relative_import_fix","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr184_relative_import_fix\nPayload:\nPublished successfully.\n\n- Pushed `e181f5f78f84ced29f74300dc2bba1cbad175b05` to `fix/cross-language-name-only-edges`.\n- PR #184: [fix(sem): stop bare type names resolving across language boundaries](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/184)\n- `headRefOid`: `e181f5f78f84ced29f74300dc2bba1cbad175b05`\n- Mergeable: `MERGEABLE`\n- Merge state: `BLOCKED`\n- All reported checks were `QUEUED`.\n- Worktree remained clean.\n\nRead-only Trail syntax identified:\n\n- Show description/metadata: `entire trail show [<trail>] [--json]`; branch override via `--branch`.\n- Edit description: `entire trail update --body '...' [--overwrite]`.\n- List all findings regardless of lifecycle/freshness: `entire trail finding list --status any --freshness any --include-dismissed --json`.\n- Resolve/dismiss: `entire trail finding resolve <finding>` and `entire trail finding dismiss <finding>`, optionally `-m`.\n- Trigger review: `entire review [--profile NAME] [--target REF] [--base REF] [--prompt TEXT] [--timeout DUR]`.\n- Approve: `entire trail approve [<trail>] [-m '...']`.\n- Trail status/gate visibility: `entire trail show --json`; repository status: `entire status --json`.\n- No Trail mutations were performed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788491007.872442}}}
