current relation edges; add compatibility/candidate-level tests now. The renamed fail-closed rule should apply to both consumers. No new ambiguity is introduced: unresolved competing candidates remain unresolved.\n\nEvidence: focused Python and language-compatibility tests passed; capabilities confirms Objective-C++ is inventory-only."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","create_time":1788491461.254003}}}
