{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:18:47.809Z","ordinal":27150,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0616d-0c18-7443-82f2-b4c5bc498542","turn_id":"01a0690a-a093-7352-9a6c-ed6ea1d6d3c0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_064395e280df5569016a9a3895fc7887d0ab48bae3483dd992","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Terra found two precise improvements:\n\n- Our broad renamed-`@objc` guard is over-conservative for same-name exports and selectors; it should compare the exported base name to the indexed Swift name.\n- Direct `import ...; ...` still loses aliases because the line scanner stops at `#` but not `;`.\n\nLuna will adjust those two points only, with FFI and selector regressions."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788491925938,"completed_at_ms":1788491927809}}
